103 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 244 0 R
/E (Sovereign Navy \(#0B2235\) is the foundation, and it's deliberate that it's almost black-blue rather than bright. This is the color of the map at night, of depth, of an institution you trust with something valuable. It says we are serious infrastructure, not a startup experiment. It's the color a sovereign wealth fund or a government data office feels comfortable looking at. It holds everything else.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
